# 📘 PROJECT EXPLANATION — Banking Management System

## 🏗️ Project Overview & Tech Stack
A console-based Banking Management System built with Core Java and MySQL, designed to demonstrate OOP, JDBC, exception handling, clean project architecture, and database management principles.
- **Tech Stack:** Core Java (Java SE), JDBC (Java Database Connectivity), MySQL Database, Console User Interface
- **Key Design Focus:** Object-Oriented Programming (OOP) principles, Data Access Object (DAO) pattern, Separation of Concerns, Exception Handling.

